@RFactAI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5027

### Happy path: 3 space facts
GET {{RFactAI_HostAddress}}/api/facts?category=space&count=3
Accept: application/json

### Default count
GET {{RFactAI_HostAddress}}/api/facts?category=animals
Accept: application/json

### 400: count above the maximum of 10
GET {{RFactAI_HostAddress}}/api/facts?category=space&count=11
Accept: application/json

### 400: missing category
GET {{RFactAI_HostAddress}}/api/facts?count=3
Accept: application/json
